    "name": "native_probe_rank5_stencil",
    "description": "An output box of rank 5: a 3-point stencil along the first and last of five axes, with zero ghost cells. Native builds it as one affine box and emits its kernel with the rank-N output odometer; the interpreter builds it per cell. The two must agree bit for bit.",
